    <http://example.org/node/chunk159> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The core approach of an AI assistance solution that leverages our retrieval-augmented generation capabilities to support hospital staff in their daily activities is based on a hybrid retrieval model that combines lexical and semantic search to provide relevant information to staff, thus facilitating access to information and improving the quality of written outputs. our proposed AI components include a retrieval module that can retrieve passages from the client's controlled corpus, which includes internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulatory texts." ;
