    <http://example.org/node/chunk16> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must take the dossier context into account where available." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk160> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This will enable an AI assistance solution that leverages our retrieval-augmented generation capabilities to support hospital staff in their daily activities to provide explainable recommendations or suggestions by citing the source of the information and providing a retrieval trace." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk161> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To support medical coding (PMSI, ICD-10) for activity reporting T2A, our propose using our structured extraction capabilities to assist staff in coding tasks. an AI assistance solution that leverages our retrieval-augmented generation capabilities to support hospital staff in their daily activities can also provide template-guided drafting to help staff generate high-quality written outputs, such as discharge summaries and medical reports. our innovation strategy is centered around an iterative approach that involves corpus selection and curation with the client's experts, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design per use case, and evaluation loops to ensure that an AI assistance solution that leverages our retrieval-augmented generation capabilities to support hospital staff in their daily activities meets the client's requirements. our will work closely with the hospital staff to understand the hospital staff needs and preferences, and adapt an AI assistance solution that leverages our retrieval-augmented generation capabilities to support hospital staff in their daily activities accordingly. our believe that our proposed AI components and innovation strategy align with the client's requirements and constraints, including the need for explainable recommendations, support for medical coding, and improved efficiency in daily activities. an AI assistance solution that leverages our retrieval-augmented generation capabilities to support hospital staff in their daily activities is designed to fit into existing practices without introducing disruption, and our are committed to providing a high level of quality and relevance in an AI assistance solution that leverages our retrieval-augmented generation capabilities to support hospital staff in their daily activities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

