    <http://example.org/node/chunk174> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project will be conducted progressively with a pilot phase on a limited perimeter of one or two departments, followed by progressive generalization to all services. an Artificial Intelligence (AI) assistance solution designed specifically for hospital staff at the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) aims to improve the efficiency of staff and quality and safety of patient care delivered to patients. an Artificial Intelligence (AI) assistance solution designed specifically for hospital staff at the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) will provide hospital staff with quick access to reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulatory texts. an Artificial Intelligence (AI) assistance solution designed specifically for hospital staff at the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) will assist in drafting clinical and administrative content, support medical coding (PMSI, ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A), and facilitate continuity of care between professionals and services. an Artificial Intelligence (AI) assistance solution designed specifically for hospital staff at the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) will integrate with the existing hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI), ensuring seamless data exchange and minimizing disruptions to clinical or administrative workflows. an Artificial Intelligence (AI) assistance solution designed specifically for hospital staff at the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) will also support health interoperability standards, including HL7, FHIR, the national health identifier (INS), and the national framework for digital health (S-GUR du numérique en santé, Mon Espace Santé, DMP)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk175> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with regulatory requirements, an Artificial Intelligence (AI) assistance solution designed specifically for hospital staff at the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) will be hosted on designed infrastructure certified to the French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) standard." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk176> a prov:Entity ;
